 at risk by being at the facility  so that's what we continue to fight for  uh continue to demand uh and push the  nfl to make sure these are as safe as uh  environments as possible  if the facility was open today would you  show up  uh me no i don't have to be there till  the 28th no but if  it was open let's say if today was  reporting day  would you be there if today was the 28th  i would be there because i'm  actually obligated to be there okay the  antonio  antonio brown situation uh where does  the nfl players association what's the  role with them  because he said he was going to retire  now he says he wants the nfl to wrap up  their investigation so he can play again  what role does the players association  play in a player  is antonio brown still a member of the  union  uh i believe i mean if he's retired he  would be a non-active player  he's retired i think he's paperwork  yeah um i'll have to look into that i  didn't see that that report whenever  that came out about him retiring then  unretiring  so i have to look into kind of what we  can do uh to help  wrap up that situation but also get back  to you yeah i'm wondering about that  that  the commissioner doesn't look at this  and go boy it's antonio brown  let me wrap this up he's got to treat  everybody the same  but it feels like it's just been kind of  hanging out there  and that's why i was curious what the  role of the you know here you are the  president of the nfl players association  and if you even get involved in  something like that  or is it management that gets involved  in this uh well that would be more  probably a lawyer for us than me  i think antonio would probably rather  have the lawyer  [Laughter]  is this your home yeah  it's kind of sparse there i got i don't  have any curtains  like what's there we've got we've got  the pull down  uh shades uh blackout shades so they're  they're up high  minimalist that that's what we went for  where's the paintings  or or posters or something we got two  paintings over there some books  uh a very very uh a white white out  environment  do you have a weight room there uh i've  got one down in the basement  oh okay uh by the way uh  but we had you on june 16th and you and  mick lovin  had a bet based off cornell dartmouth  now that game is moved to the spring i  guess  so maybe you could attend  i heard the sigh of relief when that  announcement came out  i heard that out loud when he when he  got that news that he  he wouldn't have to face the the wrath  of cornell yes mclovin  well it's typical cornell get an  extension because you know you're not  going to do well on a paper that's  something jc knows really well  oh wow any response there jc  i mean if if they are going to play in  the spring i think i will have to make  an appearance  i think that's the only way to do it  mclovin yeah as long as i have to go to  ithaca in the spring  is there a good time to go to ithaca  make 11.  that's jc because i haven't been there  there's about a month and a half  it's the perfect weather uh hey great to  talk to you again  my best to your father who i uh know uh  watches the show  and uh hopefully we got football  starting here coming up soon but thank  you again jc  absolutely appreciate that that's jc  treader he's the head of the nfl players  association he's the president in the  cleveland browns  center
 

